<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Provident Bancorp upped.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Provident Bancorp upped.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- McDonald &amp; Corp said it raised the rating on Provident Bancorp Inc to buy from hold.</p>
<p>-- increased earnings estimates to $3.05 per share from $2.90 for 1996, and to $3.70 from $3.10 for 1997.</p>
<p>-- cited impact of company's move into subprime first mortgage business.</p>
<p>-- shares closed unchanged at $43 on Wednesday.</p>
</text>
